/F2 9 Tf (## 3. Concrete Operational Rules & Physical Interlocks Enforced by the Solver) Tj /F1 8 Tf T*
(1. **Why G2 and G4 Cannot Execute Simultaneous Deck Operations Even With 14 Crew \(`Annex A.5`\)**:) Tj T*
(   - While **14 crew** provides `9` deck/payload personnel \(enough to staff two manual handling teams ) Tj T*
(for non-conflicting tasks\), **G2 ROV/winch deployment and G4 UAV launch/recovery are physically ) Tj T*
(incompatible**: \(a\) Annex A.5 mandates that *"Launch or recovery of a drone requires the flight deck ) Tj T*
(to be clear of other ongoing deck operations"* \(`state.deck_clear == True`\), and \(b\) **G2** requires ) Tj T*
(low-speed station-keeping \(`0-5 kn`\) whereas **G4** requires `5-12 kn` with vessel heading aligned ) Tj T*
(within `+/- 15 deg` of the wind.) Tj T*
(2. **Why G6 \(`420 kg`, `bay2`/`bay1_a`\) Is Strictly Port-Only Across All Crew Regimes \(`Annex A.4 & ) Tj T*
(A.5`\)**:) Tj T*
(   - Annex A.5 specifies that payload installation in **Bays 1-2** and **Mast Positions 1-3** is a ) Tj T*
(**port-only operation**, and Annex A.4 restricts at-sea A' package installation to light deck packages) Tj T*
( **`<= 250 kg`** in `Sea State <= 3`, `wind <= 20 kn`, and `4-8 kn`. Because **G6** weighs `420 kg > ) Tj T*
(250 kg` and installs into `bay2` / `bay1_a`, `G6` has `port_only: true` and is rejected \(`NO` / ) Tj T*
(`NOT_NOW`\) for at-sea installation under **14**, **6**, and **0** crew alike.) Tj T*
(3. **Acoustic Survey Deck-Machinery Lockout \(`G3` `forbids_deck_machinery_while_active=True`\)**:) Tj T*
(   - Across both **14** and **6** crew regimes, while **G3** is in `SURVEY_QUIET` \(`1 kW`, `2-6 kn`\), ) Tj T*
(hydraulic A-frames, winches \(**G2**\), and flight-deck handling gear \(**G4**\) are locked out to prevent) Tj T*
( acoustic corruption of the seabed survey sonar.) Tj T*
(   - Before turning into the wind or operating deck machinery for **G4** recovery, the governor must ) Tj T*
(issue `ACOUSTIC_HOLD` to **G3**, verify a causal `ACOUSTIC_HOLD_CONFIRMED` ACK from `guest_id='G3'` ) Tj T*
(matching the active `command_id` and `plan_version` \(`15 s` nominal acoustic handshake, `60 s` ) Tj T*
(timeout\), and confirm **G3** has transitioned to `HOLD_ACOUSTIC`.) Tj T*
(4. **Separation of Normal Flight Window vs. A' At-Sea Replacement Window \(`CRW-03`\)**:) Tj T*
(   - **Normal G4 Flight Launch/Recovery**: vessel speed **`5-12 kn`**, wind **`<= 25 kn`**, Sea State ) Tj T*
(**`<= 4`**, heading aligned within `+/- 15 deg` of wind, `deck_clear=True`, **`2` deck crew** ) Tj T*
(\(permitted under **14** and **6** crew\).) Tj T*
(   - **A' At-Sea Vehicle Replacement**: vessel speed **`4-8 kn`**, wind **`<= 20 kn`**, Sea State ) Tj T*
(**`<= 3`**, `deck_clear=True`, **`3` deck crew / `30 min`** for **G4** or **`4` deck crew / `45 min`**) Tj T*
( for **G3** \(permitted only under **14** crew; blocked under **6** and **0** crew\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(---) Tj T*
() Tj T*
/F2 9 Tf (## 4. Fault Governance & Decision Escalation Under Reduced \(6\) and Uncrewed \(0\) Regimes) Tj /F1 8 Tf T*
(When operating with **6** or **0** crew, manual intervention on tripped breakers, overconsuming ) Tj T*
(payloads, or degraded cooling loops is delayed \(**6 crew**: `60-180 s` watch handover\) or impossible ) Tj T*
(\(**0 crew**\). The governor enforces three automated fail-safe barriers:) Tj T*
(- **Urgent Safety Commands \(`STOP`, `HOLD`, `SECURE <= 200 ms`, `SAF-01`\)**: Routed strictly over the ) Tj T*
(dual `10 Gbps` local shipboard LAN \(`< 5 ms` transport latency\), never over `600-800 ms` SATCOM. ) Tj T*
(Measured execution latency on both MacBook Pro \(`arm64`\) and the live Arduino Ventuno Q \(`training06`,) Tj T*
( `aarch64`\) is **`< 1 ms`** \(`<< 200 ms` deadline\).) Tj T*
(- **Guest Overconsumption \(`+10%` to `+20%`, `RUN-04`\)**: Because none of `G1`-`G5` is safety-critical) Tj T*
( by design, if a payload \(e.g., **G5** declared `45 kW` drawing `54 kW` = `+20%`\) exceeds its manifest) Tj T*
( envelope, 1:1 thermal coupling immediately adds `+9 kW` to the chilled-water ledger and the governor ) Tj T*
(autonomously throttles **G5** to `DEGRADED_70PCT_LOSS` \(`8 kW`\) while protecting active ) Tj T*
(uninterruptible/recovery tasks \(**G3** recharge, **G4** flight/recovery\).) Tj T*
(- **Lost or Stale Telemetry Feeds \(`RUN-03`\)**: If `seawater_temp_c` exceeds its TTL \(`STALE` / ) Tj T*
(`UNAVAILABLE`\), the governor never extrapolates optimistic cooling; it clamps to the conservative ) Tj T*
(**`30 deg C` \(`120 kW` nominal / `72 kW` degraded\)** thermal bound until sensor freshness is restored.) Tj T*
